  "notes": "GAAP city. Governmental lines from the Statement of Revenues, Expenditures and Changes in Fund Balance, Total Governmental Funds column (p3; includes General, Permanent Trust, Street, Keno). Business-type (Water, Sewer, Golf) from Statement of Revenues, Expenses and Changes in Net Position total column (p5); no single total printed, so receipts = operating revenues + interest income and disbursements = operating expenses + interest expense. Transfers: governmental in 10,430 / out 63,493; business-type net +53,063; all internal. Ending cash is the 'Cash (including cash equivalents)' line of the governmental funds balance sheet (p2); the balance sheet also holds certificates of deposit 40,000, county treasurer cash 7,018 and restricted cash 377,163 and CDs 677,077. Balance sheet is the government-wide Statement of Net Position (p1), Primary Government Totals; component units (Parkview Lodge, Airport Authority) ignored. Due from/to other funds shown as printed (126,783 vs 133,468). Page 7 budgetary schedule (all funds, mixes governmental and utility funds, no object detail) not recorded in detail to avoid mixing fund types and double counting; detail left empty. Read pages 1-7 of 7"
